case revoke_blocked_read
kind negative
exec native-qemu
domain any
needs streams
# revocation while a reader is parked: it wakes REVOKED; every later use but close is REVOKED (ST4.9)
create R W A => OK
bread R 4 revoke W => REVOKED
write W "x" => REVOKED
read R 1 => REVOKED
dup R X A r => REVOKED
cancel R => REVOKED
close R => OK
close W => OK
check empty
